## Context: Errand failed because of distance, time or navigation; consumed acorn is lost.
lothlorien.message.squirrel.abort=§7La ardilla se pierde y desiste. La bellota se ha perdido.
## Context: A frightened squirrel aborts its gift errand. The already accepted acorn is not returned.
lothlorien.message.squirrel.alarmed=§7La ardilla se asusta y abandona su encargo.
## Context: Squirrel returns and drops an item gift at the player feet.
lothlorien.message.squirrel.gift=§fLa ardilla vuelve corriendo y deja algo a tus pies.
## Context: Acorn is consumed, squirrel runs away to search for a gift before returning.
lothlorien.message.squirrel.accept=§fLa ardilla toma la bellota y se pierde entre la maleza.
## Context: No standable away point could be found for the gift errand; acorn is kept.
lothlorien.message.squirrel.no_path=§7La ardilla olfatea la bellota, mira alrededor y se queda. No encuentra por dónde correr.
## Context: Squirrel is on its ten-minute gift cooldown; not a claim that it has eaten too much. Acorn is kept.
lothlorien.message.squirrel.full=§7La ardilla olfatea la bellota, pero está ocupada con sus reservas. Vuelve más tarde.
## Context: A Guest (Harmony 0 to +9) has not yet earned Friend status (Harmony +10); acorn offer is refused and the item is kept.
lothlorien.message.squirrel.untrusted=§7La ardilla olfatea la bellota y te observa, pero aún no confía en ti.
## Context: An acorn offer is refused because the player's Harmony is below 0 (Uneasy, Shunned or Hated band); acorn is kept.
lothlorien.message.squirrel.restless=§7La ardilla rehúye tu espíritu inquieto.
## Context: Guidance ended unsuccessfully. Offering another acorn can resume toward the saved gift spot.
lothlorien.message.deer.abort=§7El venado blanco pierde el camino y te deja ir. Otra bellota podría animarlo a volver a intentarlo.
## Context: Leashing the deer during guidance ends the session; it is not killed or untamed.
lothlorien.message.deer.stop_leashed=§7El venado blanco está atado y deja de guiarte.
## Context: Successful guidance ends and a plantable Great Mallorn nut is dropped in moss.
lothlorien.message.deer.gift=§fEl venado blanco se detiene e inclina la cabeza. Algo brilla en el musgo: una nuez de gran mallorn.
## Context: Guidance begins, acorn is consumed; instruct the player to follow the white deer.
lothlorien.message.deer.accept=§fEl venado blanco toma la bellota, levanta la cabeza y se da la vuelta. Síguelo.
## Context: No navigable first waypoint toward an existing gift spot; acorn is kept.
lothlorien.message.deer.no_path=§7El venado blanco mira alrededor, pero no encuentra un camino.
## Context: Guidance is refused while white deer is attached to a lead. Lead means the rope item, not leadership; acorn is kept.
lothlorien.message.deer.leashed=§7El venado blanco no te guiará mientras esté atado.
## Context: No suitable gift destination in loaded Lothlorien terrain; acorn is kept.
lothlorien.message.deer.no_spot=§7El venado blanco olfatea la bellota, mira alrededor y se queda. No tiene adónde guiarte desde aquí.
## Context: Each white deer gives a Great Mallorn nut only once. It already gave its gift; offered acorn is kept.
lothlorien.message.deer.gifted=§7El venado blanco roza la bellota con el hocico y la deja. Ya ha entregado su regalo.
## Context: White deer refuses guidance because the player's Harmony is below 0 (Uneasy, Shunned or Hated band); acorn is kept.
lothlorien.message.deer.restless=§7El venado blanco rehúye tu espíritu inquieto.
## Context: White deer gift guidance needs Friend status (Harmony +10), even though a Guest can approach the deer. Acorn is kept.
lothlorien.message.deer.untrusted=§7El venado blanco te observa, pero aún no confía en ti.
