lothlorien.message.unicorn.restless=§7El unicornio rehúye tu espíritu inquieto.
## Context: Friend status gained: the player's Harmony reached +10 inside Lothlorien after peaceful time. Gender-neutral announcement of woodland trust. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.friend.gained=§aLothlórien te cuenta entre sus amistades.
## Context: Friend status lost: Harmony dropped below +10 after a deed (a kill). Gender-neutral announcement. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.friend.lost=§7Lothlórien ya no te cuenta entre sus amistades.
## Context: Short action-bar label for the Friend band (Harmony +10), shown inside the forest. Use an impersonal friendship label to avoid assigning gender to the player. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
