lothlorien.message.lore.done.lesson=§aLección completada: %s
## Context: Chat line when all lessons of a chapter are complete and the next chapter of the Loremaster's teaching opens.
lothlorien.message.lore.chapter.opened=§fEl Maestro del saber tiene más que enseñarte.
## Context: Chat line when a player in the Shunned band (Harmony -15 to -29) uses the Loremaster: he refuses to speak, only this hint.
lothlorien.message.lore.shunned=§7Aprende a vivir en paz con el bosque y luego vuelve.
## Context: Developer diagnostic shown to the player who runs /scriptevent lothlorien:renown. Translate labels; keep technical tokens and the command.
lothlorien.message.lore.debug.state=[lothlorien] renombre %s (%s), capítulo %s, lecciones activas: %s, tarea: %s, armonía %s
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "harmony". Lesson 1 (chapter I, a deed lesson): Harmony, the standing with the forest from Hated to Friend. Peaceful time inside the forest raises it; harming the forest's creatures lowers it; the leaf icon on the action bar shows the band; Friend is exactly +10 and any wrong deed loses it. The task: reach Harmony +3 or more and press 'It is done'.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.harmony.name=La armonía del bosque
## Context: Lesson 1 (chapter I, a deed lesson): Harmony, the standing with the forest from Hated to Friend. Peaceful time inside the forest raises it; harming the forest's creatures lowers it; the leaf icon on the action bar shows the band; a long peace makes the player a Friend of Lothlórien and any wrong deed loses it. No numbers: the player never sees Harmony numbers. The task: walk in peace in the forest for several minutes (Harmony reaches the required level) and press 'It is done'.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.harmony.text=El bosque pesa cómo caminas por él. El tiempo en paz entre los árboles sana tu armonía, mientras que dañar a sus criaturas la hiere; la hoja muestra dónde estás. Quien guarda la paz mucho tiempo gana la Amistad de Lothlórien, y una sola mala acción la pierde de nuevo. Camina en paz por Lothlórien durante varios minutos y dime que está hecho.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "elves". Lesson 2 (chapter I, lore): the elves are few. No new elves are born; only the border wardens return over time; healers keep the others alive; killing an elf costs dearly in Harmony.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.elves.name=Nuestro pueblo
## Context: Lesson 2 (chapter I, lore): the elves are few. No new elves are born; only the border wardens return over time; healers keep the others alive; killing an elf costs dearly in Harmony.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.elves.text=Nuestro pueblo es escaso y no nacen nuevos elfos. Solo regresan los guardianes de la frontera, y los sanadores mantienen vivos a los demás. Alza la mano contra uno de nosotros y el precio será alto.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "renown". Lesson 3 (chapter I, lore): Renown is what the player does for the elves (separate from Harmony); ranks Stranger, Welcome, Trusted, Elf-friend; it grows with deeds and tasks, is never lost, is known in every village, and opens deeper stock with the elven traders.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.renown.name=Renombre
## Context: Lesson 3 (chapter I, lore): Renown is what the player does for the elves (separate from Harmony); it grows with deeds and tasks, is never lost, is known in every village, and opens more stock with the elven traders. The rank names are not listed in this text.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.renown.text=Mientras haces hazañas y tareas para los míos, tu renombre entre nosotros crece. Nunca se pierde, y la noticia viaja a cada aldea. Cuanto más alto está, más te ofrecerán los elfos.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "dew". Lesson 4 (chapter I, deed): morning dew. At dawn dew gathers on leaf litter and blossoms lying under Mallorn leaves; using a glass bottle on a dewy patch gives one drop and the patch dries; eight drops fill the bottle. Deed: fill a Bottle of morning dew.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.dew.name=El rocío de la mañana
## Context: Lesson 4 (chapter I, deed): morning dew. At dawn dew gathers on leaf litter and blossoms lying under Mallorn leaves; using a glass bottle on a dewy patch gives one drop and the patch dries; eight drops fill the bottle. Deed: fill a Bottle of morning dew.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.dew.text=Al primer rayo de luz las hojas lloran plata. Por la mañana el rocío se posa en la hojarasca y las flores que yacen bajo las hojas de mallorn. Usa una botella de cristal en cada lugar con rocío: cada uno da una gota y ocho llenan la botella. Llena una botella de rocío matinal.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "nectar". Lesson 5 (chapter I, deed): nectar blooms hang beneath Mallorn leaves and fill in four stages; a glass bottle on a full bloom gives Mallorn nectar and empties the bloom. Deed: bottle Mallorn nectar.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.nectar.name=El néctar de mallorn
## Context: Lesson 5 (chapter I, deed): nectar blooms hang beneath Mallorn leaves and fill in four stages; a glass bottle on a full bloom gives Mallorn nectar and empties the bloom. Deed: bottle Mallorn nectar.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.nectar.text=Las flores de néctar cuelgan bajo las hojas de mallorn y se llenan en cuatro etapas. Usa una botella de cristal en una flor llena y la flor empezará a llenarse de nuevo. Llena una botella de néctar de mallorn.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "depth". Lesson 6 (chapter II, lore): the forest has three depths measured from the border: the edge (border within about 16 blocks), the inner wood (within about 40), and the heart (farther). Real effects: border wardens off the villages' wooden decks are fewer the deeper you go; the rarest creatures are met more often deeper in.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.depth.name=La profundidad del bosque
## Context: Lesson 6 (chapter II, lore): the further into the forest, the fewer border wardens (except on the villages' wooden decks) and the more often the rarest creatures are met. No depth stage names or distances in the text.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.depth.text=Cerca del borde de Lothlórien los guardianes fronterizos caminan en número; más adentro son menos, salvo en las plataformas de madera de nuestras aldeas. Cuanto más hondo caminas, con más frecuencia encuentras a las criaturas más raras del bosque.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "lembas". Lesson 7 (chapter II, deed): Lembas. Plant Western Corn and gather its grain; three grains and a sugar make two doughs; bake the dough in a furnace or smoker to a cake; a cake plus a Mallorn leaf makes wrapped Lembas, which lifts the Hunger effect when eaten. Deed: eat wrapped Lembas.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.lembas.name=Lembas
## Context: Lesson 7 (chapter II, deed): Lembas. Plant Western Corn and gather its grain; mix the grain with sugar to make dough; bake the dough to a cake; wrap the cake in a Mallorn leaf to make wrapped Lembas, which lifts the Hunger effect when eaten. No item counts in the text. Deed: eat wrapped Lembas.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.lembas.text=Planta cereal del Oeste y recoge su grano. Mezcla el grano con azúcar para hacer masa; hornea la masa y envuelve el pastel en una hoja de mallorn. El lembas envuelto alimenta bien y quita el Hambre: la comida para un largo camino. Come un lembas envuelto.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "fireflies". Lesson 8 (chapter II, deed): fireflies appear at night (low light) above the grass of the forest; using a glass bottle on one catches it and gives a Bottle of Fireflies. Deed: catch a firefly in a bottle.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.fireflies.name=Las luciérnagas
## Context: Lesson 8 (chapter II, deed): fireflies appear at night (low light) above the grass of the forest; using a glass bottle on one catches it and gives a Bottle of Fireflies. Deed: catch a firefly in a bottle.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.fireflies.text=Tras el anochecer, las luciérnagas flotan sobre la hierba del bosque. Atrapa una con una botella de cristal: una pequeña luz para llevar o para dar al farolero. Atrapa una luciérnaga en una botella.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "rope". Lesson 9 (chapter II, deed): Elven rope is crafted from one Bottle of morning dew and a golden fern (the dew takes a whole dawn to gather). Used on the side of a block it hangs down; used on a piece it lengthens the rope up or down; it can be climbed. Deed: hang an elven rope.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.rope.name=La cuerda élfica
## Context: Lesson 9 (chapter II, deed): Elven rope is crafted from one Bottle of morning dew and a golden fern (the dew takes a whole dawn to gather). Used on the side of a block it runs all the way down or up when the player has enough rope, otherwise it can be lengthened later; it can be climbed. Deed: hang an elven rope.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.rope.text=La cuerda élfica se hace con rocío matinal y un helecho dorado, y en una cabe todo un amanecer de recolección. Úsala en el lado de un bloque y se extiende hasta el final hacia abajo o hacia arriba si tienes bastante; si no, se puede alargar después. Se puede trepar. Cuelga una cuerda élfica.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "gifts". Lesson 10 (chapter III, deed): gifts of the forest. Deer love Western Corn and a deer fed with it trusts the player; a Friend of Lothlórien (Harmony +10) may offer a Mallorn acorn to a squirrel, which runs on an errand and brings back a gift. Deed: send a squirrel off with an acorn (needs Friend).
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.gifts.name=Los dones del bosque
## Context: Lesson 10 (chapter III, deed): gifts of the forest. Deer love Western Corn and a deer fed with it trusts the player; a Friend of Lothlórien (Harmony +10) may offer a Mallorn acorn to a squirrel, which may bring a gift in return. Deed: win a squirrel's trust by offering it an acorn (needs Friend).
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.gifts.text=A los ciervos les encanta el cereal del Oeste, y un ciervo alimentado confiará en ti. Un amigo de Lothlórien puede ofrecer una bellota de mallorn a una ardilla, y esta puede traerte un regalo a cambio. Pruébalo: gánate la confianza de una ardilla.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "white_animals". Lesson 11 (chapter III, lore): a hint only. Rare white animals (the white deer and the unicorn) walk the deepest wood; to a friend of the forest they may give a gift or allow a bond. Do not name the animals plainly. Reading it enables two optional +1 Renown deeds.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.white_animals.name=Los blancos
## Context: Lesson 11 (chapter III, lore): a hint only. Rare white animals (the white deer and the unicorn) walk the deepest wood; to a friend of the forest they may give a gift or allow a bond. Do not name the animals plainly. Reading it enables two optional +1 Renown deeds.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.white_animals.text=Raras criaturas blancas caminan por lo más hondo del bosque. A un amigo del bosque pueden dar, o pueden llevar. Mantén alta tu armonía y ten paciencia.
## Context: Name of the Loremaster lesson "trades". Lesson 12 (chapter III, lore): the finest goods of the elven traders go only to an Elf-friend who is also, at that moment, a Friend of Lothlórien (Harmony +10). Renown is never lost; Harmony can be.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.trades.name=Los mejores bienes
## Context: Lesson 12 (chapter III, lore): the finest goods of the elven traders may be offered only to one who is an Elf-friend and at that moment also a Friend of Lothlórien; they cannot be found anywhere else. No remark about what is lost or kept.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.trades.text=A quien es Amigo de los elfos y también goza de la Amistad de Lothlórien, los míos pueden ofrecerle sus mejores bienes. No se encuentran en ningún otro lugar.
## Context: Request of the gardener: plant five Mallorn acorns (they become saplings) inside the forest and let them stand; the count is kept and checked on delivery.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.g_acorns.text=El jardinero pide un favor: cinco bellotas de mallorn plantadas en la tierra bajo los aleros del bosque. Plántalas dentro del bosque y deja que se mantengan en pie.
## Context: Request of the gardener: bring two Bottles of morning dew.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.g_dew.text=El jardinero pide dos frascos de rocío matinal para despertar a los árboles jóvenes.
## Context: Request of the gardener: bring sixteen bone meal.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.g_bonemeal.text=El jardinero pide dieciséis polvos de hueso para alimentar a los árboles jóvenes.
## Context: Request of the healer: bring four Athelas.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.h_athelas.text=El sanador pide cuatro athelas, la hoja del rey que cura a los heridos.
## Context: Request of the healer: bring two Mallorn nectar.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.h_nectar.text=El sanador pide dos botellas de néctar de mallorn para los enfermos.
## Context: Request of the healer: bring four Elanor and four Niphredil (flowers).
lothlorien.message.lore.req.h_flowers.text=El sanador pide cuatro elanor y cuatro niphredil, flores del bosque profundo.
## Context: Request of the woodwright: bring 32 birch or cherry logs in any mix.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.w_logs.text=El carpintero pide treinta y dos troncos de abedul o cerezo, en cualquier mezcla.
## Context: Request of the woodwright: bring eight string and eight feathers.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.w_fletching.text=El carpintero pide ocho hilos y ocho plumas para emplumar flechas.
## Context: Request of the woodwright: bring six iron ingots.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.w_iron.text=El carpintero pide seis lingotes de hierro para herramientas.
## Context: Request of the lamplighter: bring three Bottles of Fireflies.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.l_fireflies.text=El farolero pide tres frascos de luciérnagas para encender los faroles.
## Context: Request of the lamplighter: bring sixteen coal or charcoal in any mix.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.l_coal.text=El farolero pide dieciséis carbones o carbones vegetales, en cualquier mezcla, para las lámparas.
## Context: Request of the lamplighter: bring sixteen glass.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.l_glass.text=El farolero pide dieciséis vidrios para los faroles.
## Context: Interaction prompt for speaking with the Loremaster elf (opens his dialog).
action.interact.lothlorien.speak=Hablar
